        1447,
        1851,
        1571
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, Alcoholism has been recognized as any condition of abnormal behavior resulting directly or indirectly from the chronic and habitual use of alcoholic beverages; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
